      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我从小就缺乏自我主张与意志，\n是个只会遵从别人指示的少女。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c58422493948dbd5721c426f307147d4cd45919ecfd9aa48b589e167af26cf2",
