    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e099f73d698270df56532f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那样的我，看见了在GⅠ竞赛奔跑的三冠赛马娘。\n从而产生了有生以来第一次感受到的“憧憬”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10806fd2370e3dc925d053aa20b0cf80502063d0a901d638d61be8d611229c77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
