    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc689050d2c422c7f148ccd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的，Master。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b829336473569840c09723680cd1cb09c17c9e6419e732b2e6f4a95f06a61c9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343f4634ccc59d092b3b358d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁露出了浅浅的微笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a44094e9f860a7d6c7bec905d82fb9a75ca3e95dcc56526aa47e2725d1ef6d59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d727d68c4b0b1fd1f6c755bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，我和美浦波旁互相扶持的合作十分顺利。\n然而，成为她的签约训练员后，经常听到一句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2790829ea079471db6f4e5d593055f04c42e28d09be6fca810112b9a08135aa3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82b9f6feecdf09fc86189d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2814acf58cca54d150211830eeae5640e61a7c568c13143d2e948409a8072f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d42c1eed973e41fcc1417107",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "什么──！要让美浦波旁跑经典三冠！？\n太浪费了吧！为什么不让她跑短距离比赛啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28bb2067d80a40c5af3309429fb57a12b78d4bb43de04dd271fa7233086822da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e877f236bd0ea72b8fb0f411",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但无论身边的人怎么说，我们的目标就只有“取得三冠”。\n为了今后着想，也得先习惯这样的反应才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46cfcf2109ca5fbeea6910b4c6b387f9536fffbdb100a492247a505cb47b67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:873eb9e7b98e104927d21329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──所以呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fb1c2654c9b7418c7041aa9f1ea602e29637331326b7a4925c842b9654a985c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
