    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5991334c39bcfdc104d11957",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加多项目竞技大赛的草地2000米吗？已知是和新马级\n距离最长的GⅠ竞赛“希望锦标”是同等距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "992f51c795198854a074ee25ef7bdc4f71ff8964d1b33952b9bcfff764cd63d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1026/storytimeline_041026004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3746eb16ae2491f945396304",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑出好成绩让大家看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26637aa0aae59b82880abcd95c397b520052551fee74e01d3b7e094efd20d2f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
